      "label": "Downloads and runs Python and PDF tools the first time you ask about a figure; someone other than its developer can change what runs at any time",
      "concern": "medium",
      "detail": "The file belongs to yilewang, the developer of the original llm-for-zotero, not this plugin's developer: they can replace it at any time, and nothing checks it before it runs, and what they put there runs on your computer. The first time you ask about a figure, it downloads a 265–491 MB bundle of Python and the Poppler PDF tools from the original llm-for-zotero's GitHub release and runs it, without asking; the README doesn't mention it. What's there now is standard software: we checked the macOS (Apple silicon) bundle, and every file is from conda-forge."
